WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.540 --> 00:00:07.300
There was an idea

00:00:08.300 --> 00:00:12.000
To bring together
a group of remarkable people

00:00:13.700 --> 00:00:19.200
To see if we could become
something more.

00:00:20.500 --> 00:00:23.000
So when they needed us...

00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:25.000
we can fight the battles...

00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:28.000
that they never could.

00:00:46.720 --> 00:00:48.100
In time

00:00:48.400 --> 00:00:50.880
You would know what is like to lose

00:00:51.120 --> 00:00:56.500
to feel so desperately that you're right
and to fail, all the same

00:01:01.740 --> 00:01:03.740
Dread it.

00:01:04.960 --> 00:01:06.460
Run from it

00:01:07.340 --> 00:01:09.060
Destiny's still alive

00:01:17.060 --> 00:01:18.940
Evacuate the city...

00:01:20.620 --> 00:01:22.620
Engage all defenses...

00:01:23.580 --> 00:01:25.500
And get this man a shield

00:01:37.940 --> 00:01:42.020
Fun isn't something one considered from balancing the universe

00:01:44.640 --> 00:01:46.640
But this...

00:01:47.200 --> 00:01:49.200
Does put a smile on my face

00:02:16.540 --> 00:02:17.858
Who the hell are you guys ?

